Subject: [PATCH 11/19] arch/parisc: rename internal name __xchg to __arch_xchg
Date: Thu, 22 Dec 2022 12:46:27 +0100
Message-Id: <20221222114635.1251934-12-andrzej.hajda@intel.com>
